  "body": "## Bathcat intake handoff\n\n- Candidate: Horrified: Universal Monsters\n- Scope: Ravensburger article 60001836 / EAN 810558018361, Universal Monsters base game only\n- Run: `2026-08-11-horrified`\n- Cohort: cooperative\n- Packet status: `ready_for_audit`\n- Packet hash: `0151e4cda2d14003e889d2f1d39961a70d8711a4c0181e5eb0791cc6d62b2144`\n- Base at freeze: `e648f67fbf3890ee89c70317a74d1c3cacdce902`\n\n## Evidence inventory\n\n- Official identity: archived Ravensburger product page receipt `src-001`; direct current product URL returned HTTP 403 and is recorded as a retrieval state, not absence.\n- Official rules: Ravensburger-hosted Spanish ES01 instructions, 16 pages, receipt `src-002`, SHA-256 `66ac020f322f4ff1c24b715df13508301effc64f463226e6e6210d5da646b461`.\n- Independent reception: Lee Leonardo review receipt `src-003`.\n- Visuals: three reduced official Ravensburger product assets, receipts `src-004`\u2013`src-006`, plus contact sheet and derivative hashes.\n- BGG was used only as a discovery lead; no BGG rating, weight, or identity field is claimed in the packet (`bgg_id: null`).\n\n## Verification run\n\n- `validate-intake.mjs --run 2026-08-11-horrified` \u2014 clean\n- intake regression/provenance tests \u2014 46 pass, 1 intentional skip, 0 fail\n- `validate-intake.mjs --base origin/main` \u2014 clean\n- `generate-index.mjs` \u2014 completed\n- `validate-okf.mjs` \u2014 2718 files clean, INDEX fresh\n- visual validation tests \u2014 5 pass, 0 fail\n- `git diff --check` \u2014 clean\n\nThis is Bathcat's frozen **pre-approval** head. It is not promoted and must not be merged by Bathcat. Please audit this immutable packet independently, reopen the sources, and perform the Mennonite approval/promotion transition only if accepted.\n",
